{"suttaId":"tha-ap37","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[3316,3376],"vripara":"64"},"segments":{"tha-ap37:0.3":"Mogharājattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap37:1.1":"“Atthadassī tu bhagavā, sayambhū aparājito;","tha-ap37:1.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghaparibyūḷho, rathiyaṃ paṭipajjatha.","tha-ap37:2.1":"“Sissehi samparivuto, gharamhā abhinikkhamiṃ;","tha-ap37:2.3":"Nikkhamitvānahaṃ tattha, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap37:3.1":"“Abhivādiya sambuddhaṃ, sire katvāna añjaliṃ;","tha-ap37:3.3":"Sakaṃ cittaṃ pasādetvā, santhaviṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap37:4.1":"“Yāvatā rūpino sattā, arūpī vā asaññino;","tha-ap37:4.3":"Sabbe te tava ñāṇamhi, anto honti samogadhā.","tha-ap37:5.1":"“Sukhumacchikajālena, udakaṃ yo parikkhipe;","tha-ap37:5.3":"Ye keci udake pāṇā, antojāle bhavanti te.","tha-ap37:6.1":"“Yesañca cetanā atthi, rūpino ca arūpino;","tha-ap37:6.3":"Sabbe te tava ñāṇamhi, anto honti samogadhā.","tha-ap37:7.1":"“Samuddharasimaṃ lokaṃ, andhakārasamākulaṃ;","tha-ap37:7.3":"Tava dhammaṃ suṇitvāna, kaṅkhāsotaṃ taranti te.","tha-ap37:8.1":"“Avijjānivute loke, andhakārena otthaṭe;","tha-ap37:8.3":"Tava ñāṇamhi jotante, andhakārā padhaṃsitā.","tha-ap37:9.1":"“Tuvaṃ cakkhūsi sabbesaṃ, mahātamapanūdano;","tha-ap37:9.3":"Tava dhammaṃ suṇitvāna, nibbāyati bahujjano.","tha-ap37:10.1":"“Puṭakaṃ pūrayitvāna [pīṭharaṃ (sī.), putaraṃ (syā.)], madhukhuddamaneḷakaṃ;","tha-ap37:10.3":"Ubho hatthehi paggayha, upanesiṃ mahesino.","tha-ap37:11.1":"“Paṭiggaṇhi mahāvīro, sahatthena mahā isī;","tha-ap37:11.3":"Bhuñjitvā tañca sabbaññū, vehāsaṃ nabhamuggami.","tha-ap37:12.1":"“Antalikkhe ṭhito satthā, atthadassī narāsabho;","tha-ap37:12.3":"Mama cittaṃ pasādento, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap37:13.1":"“‘Yenidaṃ thavitaṃ ñāṇaṃ, buddhaseṭṭho ca thomito;","tha-ap37:13.3":"Tena cittappasādena, duggatiṃ so na gacchati.","tha-ap37:14.1":"“‘Catuddasañcakkhattuṃ [catusaṭṭhiñca (syā.)] so, devarajjaṃ karissati;","tha-ap37:14.3":"Pathabyā rajjaṃ aṭṭhasataṃ, vasudhaṃ āvasissati.","tha-ap37:15.1":"“‘Pañceva satakkhattuñca [atha pañcasatakkhattuṃ (sī.)], cakkavattī bhavissati;","tha-ap37:15.3":"Padesarajjaṃ asaṅkheyyaṃ, mahiyā kārayissati.","tha-ap37:16.1":"“‘Ajjhāyako mantadharo, tiṇṇaṃ vedāna pāragū;","tha-ap37:16.3":"Gotamassa bhagavato, sāsane pabbajissati.","tha-ap37:17.1":"“‘Gambhīraṃ nipuṇaṃ atthaṃ, ñāṇena vicinissati;","tha-ap37:17.3":"Mogharājāti nāmena, hessati satthu sāvako.","tha-ap37:18.1":"“‘Tīhi vijjāhi sampannaṃ, katakiccamanāsavaṃ;","tha-ap37:18.3":"Gotamo satthavāhaggo, etadagge ṭhapessati’.","tha-ap37:19.1":"“Hitvā mānusakaṃ yogaṃ, chetvāna bhavabandhanaṃ;","tha-ap37:19.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap37:20.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap37:21.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā mogharājo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap37:22.1":"Mogharājattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2459,"to":2460,"paras":[{"para":2459,"vripara":"64","refs":["tha-ap37:1"],"lines":["Evaṃ so paṇidhānānurūpena arahattaphalaṃ patvā attano pubbasambhāraṃ disvā pubbakammāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>atthadassī tu bhagavā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ uttānatthameva."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap37:1"],["tha-ap37:1"]]},{"para":2460,"vripara":"73","refs":["tha-ap37:10"],"lines":["<b>Puṭakaṃ pūrayitvānā</b>ti puṭakaṃ vuccati vārakaṃ, ghaṭaṃ vā.","<b>Aneḷakaṃ</b> niddosaṃ makkhikaṇḍavirahitaṃ khuddamadhunā ghaṭaṃ pūretvā taṃ ubhohi hatthehi <b>paggayha</b> pakārena ādarena gahetvā <b>mahesino</b> bhagavato upanesinti sambandho.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap37:10"],["tha-ap37:10"],["tha-ap37:10"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap37:1.1","atthadassī tu bhagavā",0,0],["tha-ap37:10.1","puṭakaṃ pūrayitvānā",1,0],["tha-ap37:10.1","aneḷakaṃ",1,1],["tha-ap37:10.3","mahesino",1,1],["tha-ap37:10.3","paggayha",1,1]]},"tika":null}
